@startuml Sum_Ssfm_Service0x14_Handler_SeqDiag

participant Dcm as Dcm
box SUM_SSFM
    participant Sum_Ssfm_Service0x14_Handler as Service0x14
end box

participant Sum_SUSD as SUSD
participant Sum_SOH as SOH

activate Service0x14

group ClearDiagnosticInfomration request confirmation
Dcm -> Service0x14: Runnable_SSFM_ServiceRequest_Confirmation is invoked \n by operation Confirmation of diagnostic request
alt SID is 0x14
    alt (ConfirmationStatus is DCM_RES_POS_OK)
		Service0x14 -> Service0x14: clear application related DTC flags
		Service0x14 -> Service0x14: clear application data related DID E0B9.
		Service0x14 -> Service0x14: clear the AuthenticationWindowTimer and \nFailedAuthenticationTimer flags for each KeySlot configured.
        Service0x14 -> SUSD: provide a notification as FALSE back to SUSD
        Service0x14 -> SOH: send notification to SUM_SOH regarding the approval of a clear diagnostic request.
	else other status
		Service0x14 -> SOH: send notification to SUM_SOH regarding the rejection of a clear diagnostic request.
	end		
end
end
deactivate Service0x14

@enduml 